d changed-condition instances\n- advances the cumulative P4 projection and active manifest while preserving all P4-01..03 artifact bytes\n- makes the historical P4-03 regression successor-aware without mutating its source or delta\n\n## Mandatory visual review\n\nWorker review opened every authenticated lossless full-chain sheet (73/73 bundles, 279/279 original images). The checked-in visual authority explicitly covers force directions, rough/smooth contact, friction, tension/thrust/resistance/reaction, strings/pulleys/rods, geometry and angle placement, positive direction/acceleration, and changed/shared diagrams.\n\nThis PR is ready for the required independent semantic reviewer to reopen the complete 73-bundle QP/MS chains at exact head. No semantic approval in this PR is text-only.\n\n## Metrics\n\n- parent inventory: 480 questions, 1,317 QuestionParts, 967 score-owning, 350 instruction-only\n- parent visual authority: 480 active bundle identities, 1,743 physical image paths\n- P4-04: 73 questions / 207 parts (147 score-owning / 60 instruction-only)\n- P4-04 dispositions: 91 approved / 56 candidate / 60 abstain\n- reviewed Newton parts with QP visual review: 100%\n- approved score parts with MS visual review: 100%\n- cumulative source: 583 approved / 127 candidate / 607 abstain\n- reviewed projection: 583 approved / 127 candidate / 250 abstain / 0 rejected\n- cumulative visual review: 359 questions / 960 parts / 536 QP images / 765 MS images\n- procedures: 982 instances / 22 models / 44.636364 reuse ratio / 272 supporting instances\n- remaining terminal disposition: Energy only, 121 questions / 357 parts (256 score-owning / 101 instruction-only)\n\n## Required gates\n\n- P4-03 authenticated predecessor preservation: PASS\n- force/direction/contact relation inferred without visible evidence: 0\n- text-only semantic approvals: 0\n- candidate exposed as approved: 0\n- Forces-vs-Newton primary ownership conflicts: 0\n- duplicate cross-Family ProcedureModels: 0\n- future predecessor global mutation: 0\n- historical byte changes: 0\n- full structural graph copies: 0\n- remote data writes: 0\n- deterministic cumulative rebuild: PASS\n\nHistorical custody:\n\n- P4-03 reviewed source SHA-256: `828beac86e8ec1d73feb3cea3bc9f76a668b318ca0851aa7869b425a08b14ded`\n- P4-03 delta SHA-256: `107a23977363f0644a783c14fd93976702f1bca75c6e9b052b4e3977cace36d4`\n- P4-04 reviewed source SHA-256: `7857d84e14457f7d3a8d474af1867e9df043b2887bb1143c644d5d48ecf0aaf8`\n- P4-04 delta SHA-256: `e4f0d0bd2f50d273ce8a0809957c2851c7ea3314a1a9cd3faf835f46e20d8c64`\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1772_p4_forces_equilibrium_semantic_kg.test.py -q` — 10 passed\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1773_p4_kinematics_semantic_kg.test.py -q` — 9 passed\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1774_p4_momentum_semantic_kg.test.py -q` — 12 passed\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1775_p4_newton_semantic_kg.test.py -q` — 14 passed; physical corpus authentication PASS; deterministic rebuild PASS\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1766_future_semantic_kg_producer.test.py -q` — 30 passed\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1767_future_semantic_kg_harness.test.py -q` — 27 passed\n\nTotal: 102 tests passed.","created_at":"2026-07-29T18:23:16Z","updated_at":"2026-07-29T19:08:24Z","closed_at":"2026-07-29T19:02:18Z","merged_at":"2026-07-29T19:02:18Z","merge_commit_sha":"565c359779037ba0443fbecc9b37387a3a1633fd","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1781/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1781/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1781/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/rep